    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In DC3: Viral Menace, you play as Dr. Vidya Vichaar, battling a viral infection ravaging her daughter's body. Zoom through artfully crafted levels themed as pages of a comic book in Vidya's magnificent technological ship - The Caper-5000.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate various systems of the human body in this top-down, isometric adventure. Begin in the cavernous respiratory system, descend into the acidic digestive system, propel through the expansive circulatory system, and end your journey in the thunderous nervous system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize an arsenal of unique weapons, clever upgrades, and powerful turrets to fight hordes of enemies and defend your side-kick, CaByte, as he collects valuable antigen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336040/extras/1f5dafcafa760291b63f627622a6ccc8.poster.avif?t=1749410198\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336040/extras/1f5dafcafa760291b63f627622a6ccc8.webm?t=1749410198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336040/extras/1f5dafcafa760291b63f627622a6ccc8.mp4?t=1749410198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move</strong> - Hover through the human body by utilizing your Wub-Wub Engines or soar over giant chasms between cells and tissue by activating your Hover engines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fight</strong> - Hold your ground against waves of viruses that stand between you and the cure.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Collect</strong> - Use CaByte and the ampoule system to collect enriched virus' guts, a.k.a, antigen.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Power-Up</strong> - Aisle Kyoor, your ally on the outside, provides you with power Blueprints that modify and strengthen your ship's capabilities.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336040/extras/12821767ffea63e8ae1611f392c2cf61.poster.avif?t=1749410198\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336040/extras/12821767ffea63e8ae1611f392c2cf61.webm?t=1749410198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336040/extras/12821767ffea63e8ae1611f392c2cf61.mp4?t=1749410198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The Swarm</strong> - These pesky flocks may seem weak, but their strength is in their numbers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The Mini-Bosses</strong>- Exhibiting a distinct desire to eliminate your ship with their dangerous attacks, these bulky agents mean business. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The Bosses</strong> - Genetically crafted to pack a solid punch, these biological behemoths will stop at nothing to cut your journey short. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336040/extras/88fe9ca59f59430aeb221cfc638f137f.poster.avif?t=1749410198\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336040/extras/88fe9ca59f59430aeb221cfc638f137f.webm?t=1749410198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336040/extras/88fe9ca59f59430aeb221cfc638f137f.mp4?t=1749410198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Deploy </strong> - Task CaByte with building stationary but powerful turrets in strategic locations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Control </strong> - Harness your turret's unique abilities to recuperate your resources, slow enemy movement, or even weaken their defenses. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Utilize </strong> - Bolster your cannon to deliver a crushing blow to those stoic bastards that seem to explode out of every cell.  </p></li></ul>",
