type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Deploy </strong> - Task CaByte with building stationary but powerful turrets in strategic locations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Control </strong> - Harness your turret's unique abilities to recuperate your resources, slow enemy movement, or even weaken their defenses. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Utilize </strong> - Bolster your cannon to deliver a crushing blow to those stoic bastards that seem to explode out of every cell.  </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Explore the human body with Dr. Capsule and her trusty ship, the Caper-5000 in this comic book-themed, sci-fi, twin-stick adventure. DC3: Viral Menace, obliges players with cathartic violence against the scariest unliving creatures on our planet - viruses.",
